r Alex Jones?</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/116092526849970304/comments/default/116114503910994267'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/116092526849970304/comments/default/116114503910994267'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/10/only-reason-to-vote-republican.html?showComment=1161145020000#c116114503910994267' title=''/><author><name>arne</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/05971811866752566814</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/10/only-reason-to-vote-republican.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-116092526849970304' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/116092526849970304' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1898690585"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 17, 2006 at 10:17 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-116095611891304875</id><published>2006-10-15T17:48:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2006-10-15T17:48:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>will,still months after your initial posting, ron ...</title><content type='html'>will,&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;still months after your initial posting, ron paul is still the only republican worth voting for.  &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;please keep the posts coming! :-)</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/116092526849970304/comments/default/116095611891304875'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/116092526849970304/comments/default/116095611891304875'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/10/only-reason-to-vote-republican.html?showComment=1160956080000#c116095611891304875' title=''/><author><name>rick</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/12473173027048173880</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/10/only-reason-to-vote-republican.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-116092526849970304' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/116092526849970304' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-870704727"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 15, 2006 at 5:48 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-116094800800812810</id><published>2006-10-15T15:33:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2006-10-15T15:33:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>We know the lefties (USSR) are just as good at cre...</title><content type='html'>We know the lefties (USSR) are just as good at creating a police state as the righties (Nazi Germany).&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;So why bother voting for anyone in November?</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/116092526849970304/comments/default/116094800800812810'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/116092526849970304/comments/default/116094800800812810'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/10/only-reason-to-vote-republican.html?showComment=1160947980000#c116094800800812810' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/10/only-reason-to-vote-republican.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-116092526849970304' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/116092526849970304' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 15, 2006 at 3:33 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-116094054235533405</id><published>2006-10-15T13:29:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2006-10-15T13:29:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>I just wanted to add that it was your writing at J...</title><content type='html'>I just wanted to add that it was your writing at JBS that had me this close to actually subscribing to the New American and joining the JBS, something I never thought my &quot;liberal&quot; background would permit me to contemplate in this lifetime. &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Glad to see you&#39;ve a home at LRC also. Please keep telling it like you see it.. the message is reaching more people than you could possibly imagine.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/116092526849970304/comments/default/116094054235533405'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/116092526849970304/comments/default/116094054235533405'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/10/only-reason-to-vote-republican.html?showComment=1160940540000#c116094054235533405' title=''/><author><name>zchris63</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/15044325194992357871</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/10/only-reason-to-vote-republican.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-116092526849970304' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/116092526849970304' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-60614549"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 15, 2006 at 1:29 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-116094018567582351</id><published>2006-10-15T13:23:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2006-10-15T13:23:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>I&#39;ve seen several remarks at JBS about their faith...</title><content type='html'>I&#39;ve seen several remarks at JBS about their faithful nonpartisan position on all things they do, and then see them get riled at criticism of policies being marshalled by a specific party, so much so that they fire the author, and think to myself &quot;what hypocrites.&quot; &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Glad to see you have your own blog. Consider me a regular and keep up the good work.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/116092526849970304/comments/default/116094018567582351'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/116092526849970304/comments/default/116094018567582351'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/10/only-reason-to-vote-republican.html?showComment=1160940180000#c116094018567582351' title=''/><author><name>zchris63</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/15044325194992357871</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/10/only-reason-to-vote-republican.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-116092526849970304' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/116092526849970304' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-60614549"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 15, 2006 at 1:23 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-116093332441727301</id><published>2006-10-15T11:28:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2006-10-15T11:28:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>If the Republican Party has any virtue left, then ...</title><content type='html'>If the Republican Party has any virtue left, then sound, well-documented, Constitution-based criticisms of Party policies will actually be respected, and might even &quot;make nice&quot; with the GOP. &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;On the other hand, David Kuo, the former second-in-command of Bush&#39;s Office of Faith-Based Initiatives, has &lt;A HREF=&quot;http://www.latimes.com/news/nationworld/nation/la-na-faith13oct13,0,3875008.story?coll=la-home-headlines&quot; REL=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;revealed&lt;/A&gt; that conservative Christians who simply support the Republican oligarchy like fawning sycophants receive no respect whatsoever.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Writes &lt;A HREF=&quot;http://www.msnbc.msn.com/id/15228489/&quot; REL=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;Jonathan Larsen&lt;/A&gt;, producer of &quot;Countdown&quot; with Keith Olbermann:&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;[Kuo] says some of the nation’s most prominent evangelical leaders were known in the office of presidential political strategist Karl Rove as “the nuts.” &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;“National Christian leaders received hugs and smiles in person and then were dismissed behind their backs and described as ‘ridiculous,’ ‘out of control,’ and just plain ‘goofy,’” Kuo writes.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Grudging, behind-the-scenes respect is better than public honor and private disdain.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Doesn&#39;t the JBS understand this by now?&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;And if the GOP has no virtue left, who cares if they&#39;re put off by our trenchant criticism? We can attract the majority of Americans who do not care what Karl Rove and George Bush think; that&#39;s where the future lies.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Kevin Craig&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;A HREF=&quot;http://StoptheSPP.us&quot; REL=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;www.STOPtheSPP.us&lt;/A&gt;</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/116092526849970304/comments/default/116093332441727301'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/116092526849970304/comments/default/116093332441727301'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/10/only-reason-to-vote-republican.html?showComment=1160933280000#c116093332441727301' title=''/><author><name>Kevin Craig</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/13791665376871006026</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2006/10/only-reason-to-vote-republican.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-116092526849970304' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/116092526849970304' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1560454633"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 15, 2006 at 11:28 AM"/></entry></feed>